# "What the machine has" — the hardware-detection chapter's program.
#
# On a video machine every bit of the probe byte is set, which is the machine
# the guide describes: a complete ACE. Asserted on the screen rather than the
# console because that is where a video machine's output goes.

console video

screen ^WHAT THIS MACHINE HAS\s*$
screen ^BANKED RAM, LOW\s+YES\s*$
screen ^MEMORY CARD\s+YES\s*$
screen ^KEYBOARD AND STICKS\s+YES\s*$
screen ^VIDEO\s+YES\s*$
